    {
      "block_id": "BL-6137-3.2.03-11",
      "block_type": "plain_explanation",
      "heading": "",
      "text": "Support can alter the chain. Reliable care, suitable leave, accessible transport or income protection may reduce avoidable interruption. Education and respectful services can make prevention and treatment more usable. Their success requires delivery and appropriate outcomes. A policy title or a count of leaflets is not equivalent to stable health, continued schooling or protected income.",
